<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 18.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Oct 18.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Friday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali and trade union leader Ismail Sahbani discuss negotiations on public sector wages.</p>
<p>- IBM takes Tunis as its headquarters for North Africa and Malta.</p>
<p>ASSABAH</p>
<p>- Industry Ministry committee approves plans for the modernisation of 36 firms as part of a programme to enable Tunisian companies prepare for greater competition.</p>
</text>
